usage: transport.py [-h] (--input INPUT | --samples SAMPLES)
                    [--metadata METADATA] [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT]
                    [--source-root SOURCE_ROOT] --output OUTPUT [--gpu GPU]
                    [--seed SEED] [--n-samples N_SAMPLES]

Export native saved-model samples, or render an existing sample bundle
offline. python -m paper.transport --input runs/results/JOB/result.json --gpu
0 --output figures/transport python -m paper.transport --samples
RUN/samples.npz --output figures/continental

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input INPUT         Completed public worker result.json for checkpoint-
                        derived sampling.
  --samples SAMPLES     Existing numeric sample NPZ to render with no JAX
                        import.
  --metadata METADATA   Defaults to samples.json beside --samples.
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --output OUTPUT
  --gpu GPU
  --seed SEED
  --n-samples N_SAMPLES
